{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n \\\"<new_puzzle index=\\\\\\\"3\\\\\\\"|bbox|rotation|包围盒\\\" /home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/des.md /home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/prompt.md\"","aggregated_output":"/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/prompt.md:102:The non-center red sprite is an eight-neighbor direction from the center; the other two colored arms are fixed rotations of that direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/prompt.md:252:- The relevant objects are square frames or filled squares: their bbox is square\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/prompt.md:253:  and all cells on the bbox border have the object's color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/des.md:45:- 实际上，所有对象的像素数量相同（形状相同则面积必然相同）。区分排序的关键属性不是面积，而是对象的\"包围盒面积\"（最小外接矩形的行数×列数）。不同对象虽然像素形状相同，但在网格中的旋转状态不同（0°、90°、180°、270°），导致包围盒尺寸不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/des.md:49:- 计算每个对象的包围盒面积（行数×列数）。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/des.md:50:- 按包围盒面积从小到大排序；若相同，则按对象左上角的行号从小到大排序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed581286445/5/des.md:55:对象表面上\"形状相同\"，解题者需要注意到它们其实是同一模板的不同旋转态，而旋转导致包围盒不同；排序键是包围盒而非像素数或位置，颜色的循环移位规则需要从多个样例中归纳——\"识别旋转→按包围盒排序→循环换色\"构成三层推理。\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
